    "note-xn9jsr": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "page": "page-dpqe21",
      "text": "Share media\n• Replaces the Share screen button in the media group. The icon is a plus in a frame\n• Clicking it opens a white picker above the button. Types sit along the bottom: Slides, Video, Screen, Audio, URL, More\n• Slides: Add slides plus your decks; the selected deck gets a blue border and check\n• Screen: entire screen, a window or a browser tab (tabs can include audio)\n• Video and URL: paste a link; Audio: share computer audio\n• In the Command bar concept, Share media lives in the More grid\n\nTry it in Play: click the media button, then switch types.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 2027,
      "y": 884
    },
